  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 — Package and security maintenance. Clears high-severity npm audit\n      and NuGet audit findings (browserslist, Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git via SourceLink 10.0.401), updates\n      .NET test and OpenAPI dependencies, and improves OAS 3.1 support in the SPA: schema examples[0] is\n      used when example is absent, and oneOf/anyOf null wrappers are shown as nullable. No public API\n      changes. See CHANGELOG.md for full history.",
